  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Variant_Chiseled_Bookshelves/BH_Variant_Chiseled_Bookshelves_Header.webp\" alt=\"\" /></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">解開古老知識的奧秘，並透過「變體雕花書架」模組提升您圖書館的美感。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">這款為《我的世界》增添的迷人模組，引入了多款優雅的書架，每一款都經過精心設計，以搭配遊戲中的經典木材風格。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">沉浸在橡木、白楊木、雲杉木、叢林木、金合歡木、深色橡木、緋紅木、竹、紅樹林木、櫻花木和扭曲木書架豐富多樣的質感與色調中。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">無論您是打算擴建附魔室，還是打造一個舒適的閱讀角落，「變體雕花書架」模組都能兼顧實用性與美觀性。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">透過這款迷人的模組，探索客製化書籍收納之美吧！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6UHsUm3.png\" /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">「變體雕花書架」模組為每種原版木板類型新增了一款雕花書架。</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">所有紋理均已壓縮（不會產生任何負面影響），以將模組檔案大小降至最低。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">所有紋理皆使用對應木板的十六進位顏色手動製作，以確保外觀正確無誤。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">已包含所有變體還原為原版物品的合成配方，以防出現任何問題。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">原版書架更名為橡木書架，並微調了顏色以更好地契合橡木材質。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6UHsUm3.png\" /></span></h6>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/JMxYXtMz5r\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=452161&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"208\" height=\"50\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://github.com/xanthian\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Github&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=452161&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"200\" height=\"50\" /></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/xanthian\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Variant_Crafting/BH_VC_BisectPromo.png\" width=\"533\" height=\"80\" /></a></p>",
